{"id":"a6968cf821709ca1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FProv.md","title":"FProv","display":"FProv","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FProv","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FProv"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶证明。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FProv E F R f r g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists p (@ FProof E F R f r g p a))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8fb767de006c9ca\" href=\"?note=c8fb767de006c9ca\" title=\"ZFC_FProof\">FProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FProv E F R f r g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FProof","status":"resolved","id":"c8fb767de006c9ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProof|FProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":781,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b7468bb3bf4643b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryNaive|TheoryNaive]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"6bbcc3ada08324af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_TheoryPA|TheoryPA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"1de9e240a400be73","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_PresSig|PresSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryPres|TheoryPres]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"dbaa986b9d2b3572","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_TheoryQ|TheoryQ]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"ed5fd701874368a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]"},{"id":"848548ce73696e36","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]"},{"id":"0f261b71f14b6de3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_TheoryTA|TheoryTA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"68bd4c202606f4ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryZFC|TheoryZFC]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"681782689e2ce2f4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FProv|FProv]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryZF|TheoryZF]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"ebde6ba91a948261","anchor":"r